SafeSABR
Copyright 2026 SafeSABR authors

This repository contains the SafeSABR research code for risk-calibrated
adaptive bitrate streaming over Starlink traces.

Some ABR simulator components are adapted from open-source ABR research
codebases, including Pensieve and Comyco-style simulation environments. Those
projects are distributed under permissive open-source licenses. SafeSABR keeps
the simulator lineage visible in source comments and uses the adapted
components only as the ABR simulation substrate for the SafeSABR method.

StarNet data are not redistributed in this repository. Users should obtain
StarNet from the official repository:
https://github.com/ConnectedSystemsLab/StarNet

